<title>USA: TABLE-Monro Muffler Brake Inc Q1 shr flat.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Monro Muffler Brake Inc Q1 shr flat.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended June 30,</p>
<p>						1997	     1996 % Change</p>
<p> Sales				    $40,773	 $37,745    8.0%</p>
<p>Cost of sales, including</p>
<p>  distribution and occupancy costs  22,631	  20,666   9.5</p>
<p> Gross profit			     18,142	  17,079   6.2</p>
<p>Operating, selling, general and</p>
<p>  administrative expenses	     11,492	  10,645   8.0</p>
<p> Operating income			  6,650	   6,434   3.4</p>
<p> Interest expense, net		     868	     814   6.5</p>
<p> Other expense, net			   85		16</p>
<p>Income before provision for</p>
<p>  income taxes			     5,697	   5,604   1.7</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes	    2,280	   2,225   2.4</p>
<p> Net income				  3,417	   3,379   1.1</p>
<p> Earnings per share (a)		   0.40	    0.40    0%</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>outstanding (including common</p>
<p>  stock equivalents) (a)		 8,605	   8,540</p>
