<p>  (at end of quarter)			324	     284</p>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: (a)  All share data has been restated to reflect five percent stock dividend payable to shareholders of record as of June 20, 1997.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
